1
00:00:01,181 --> 00:00:09,221
The Princess Sapphire

2
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,160
♪ Atashi no miru yume himitsu nano ♪
The dreams I see are my secret

3
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:57,089
♪ Dare ni mo iwanai himitsu nano ♪
I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret

4
00:00:58,541 --> 00:01:02,461
♪ Akai manto hira hira ♪
A red cape fluttering

5
00:01:02,462 --> 00:01:04,981
♪ Uma o tobasu oujo ♪
Galloping on a horse—the princess

6
00:01:04,981 --> 00:01:06,901
♪ Sore ga atashi ♪
That’s me!

7
00:01:07,621 --> 00:01:10,901
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

8
00:01:10,905 --> 00:01:13,424
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

9
00:01:14,541 --> 00:01:18,021
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

10
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:20,741
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

11
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:25,220
♪ Ribon no kishi wa ♪
The Princess Knight,

12
00:01:25,220 --> 00:01:28,621
♪ Honto wa hontto wa ♪
Truly, truly,

13
00:01:28,622 --> 00:01:31,822
♪ Atashi nano sa ♪
It’s really me!

14
00:01:44,101 --> 00:01:50,141
Twenty-Sixth Episode
The Icicle Queen

15
00:02:18,701 --> 00:02:20,532
Copperland...

16
00:02:21,301 --> 00:02:24,213
Soon all the countries of the world
will be mine!

17
00:02:24,421 --> 00:02:27,379
Tell me, Gelo:
what will be the next country?

18
00:02:27,421 --> 00:02:29,537
Choose Silverland!

19
00:02:29,581 --> 00:02:32,015
Oh, Silverland
is a splendid country!

20
00:02:32,061 --> 00:02:34,017
I have desperately wanted it

21
00:02:34,061 --> 00:02:36,859
But they say there is
an unyielding Princess..

22
00:02:36,901 --> 00:02:38,698
...called "Sapphire".

23
00:02:39,461 --> 00:02:41,770
Don't worry, Queen!

24
00:02:41,821 --> 00:02:44,893
To begin with,
invite the girl to Coolland.

25
00:02:44,941 --> 00:02:48,331
Invite her to Coolland?! And after
inviting her, what will we do?

26
00:02:50,101 --> 00:02:52,376
During her absence..

27
00:02:53,541 --> 00:02:57,375
...I will make sure that someone
gets rid of the King and Queen.

28
00:02:58,261 --> 00:03:02,777
Fortunately, in Silverland there is
an evil man named Geralamon,

29
00:03:02,821 --> 00:03:05,210
who could be very useful to us!

30
00:03:30,421 --> 00:03:32,855
Grand Duke,
there is absolutely no one here

31
00:03:32,901 --> 00:03:35,290
It's strange,
but I'm sure he will come

32
00:03:35,381 --> 00:03:38,453
Welcome, Grand Duke Geralamon!

33
00:03:39,941 --> 00:03:42,216
Have you already devised a way.

34
00:03:42,261 --> 00:03:45,333
...to eliminate the King and Queen
secretly?

35
00:03:45,381 --> 00:03:48,020
But will you then make me
Lord of Silverland?

36
00:03:48,261 --> 00:03:50,650
You don't have to worry about that.

37
00:03:50,701 --> 00:03:52,896
The Queen never lies!

38
00:03:52,941 --> 00:03:56,331
Alright, then let me
take care of the King and the Queen.

39
00:03:56,381 --> 00:03:58,497
Do you think you can do it
so easily?

40
00:03:58,541 --> 00:04:00,099
I will use Satan.

41
00:04:00,141 --> 00:04:02,132
As a reward,
I will give him Sapphire's heart.

42
00:04:02,181 --> 00:04:04,172
Wonderful idea!

43
00:04:14,821 --> 00:04:16,493
I'm going!

44
00:04:18,901 --> 00:04:21,096
Is it right for her to go alone?

45
00:04:21,141 --> 00:04:24,099
Don't worry, the one who
invited her is no ordinary person:

46
00:04:24,141 --> 00:04:26,018
Queen Icicle of Coolland.

47
00:04:26,221 --> 00:04:28,132
Goodbye!

48
00:04:28,221 --> 00:04:31,293
But it seems she is called that
because of her coldness.

49
00:04:41,781 --> 00:04:43,578
Sapphire!

50
00:04:44,141 --> 00:04:47,338
- Hi, Choppy!
- Where are you going?

51
00:04:48,701 --> 00:04:51,818
- I'm going to Coolland!
- Really? Can I come with you?

52
00:04:51,861 --> 00:04:54,295
But it's very cold there, you know?

53
00:04:54,501 --> 00:04:56,810
It doesn't matter! Take me with you, come on!

54
00:04:56,861 --> 00:04:58,852
Alright, let's go there together!

55
00:04:58,901 --> 00:05:01,574
How wonderful! Thank you!
Thank you so much, Sapphire!

56
00:05:14,741 --> 00:05:18,416
He left on his own before
we tried to get rid of him!

57
00:05:35,381 --> 00:05:37,417
Soon we'll reach the border.

58
00:05:42,261 --> 00:05:45,651
How vast it is...!
The Queen must be very greedy

59
00:05:46,581 --> 00:05:49,334
It's not right to speak ill of her,
Choppy.

60
00:06:04,181 --> 00:06:07,253
- Who are you? - Did you know that here
is the border of Coolland?

61
00:06:08,101 --> 00:06:11,411
What are you doing?
I am Sapphire of Silverland!

62
00:06:11,541 --> 00:06:13,577
I'm sorry, Princess Sapphire.

63
00:06:13,620 --> 00:06:16,533
There is a carriage ready
to welcome you. I will call for it right away.

64
00:06:20,860 --> 00:06:22,533
Good heavens!

65
00:06:36,180 --> 00:06:38,820
Princess Sapphire,
I have come to welcome you.

66
00:06:38,860 --> 00:06:41,250
- Do you want to get into the carriage?
- No, no, thank you.

67
00:06:41,300 --> 00:06:42,893
I will go with Opal.

68
00:06:42,940 --> 00:06:44,932
Excuse me,
but such a wretched horse...

69
00:06:44,980 --> 00:06:47,211
...is not worthy of belonging
to a Princess.

70
00:06:47,260 --> 00:06:48,933
Opal is not wretched!

71
00:06:48,980 --> 00:06:53,338
Do you mean you are not
satisfied with the carriage?

72
00:06:54,140 --> 00:06:56,018
A golden carriage?

73
00:06:56,620 --> 00:06:59,852
My dear, you must behave
like a Princess.

74
00:07:01,540 --> 00:07:04,419
I understand, I will
get in. Are you pleased?

75
00:07:05,660 --> 00:07:08,016
I'm sorry, Opale,
but you must leave.

76
00:07:09,500 --> 00:07:12,334
- Choppy, come! Let's get in, come on!
- Yes.

77
00:07:13,500 --> 00:07:15,617
- Wait! Not you!
- Why not?!

78
00:07:15,660 --> 00:07:17,458
I told him to get in!

79
00:07:17,500 --> 00:07:20,095
This carriage is for you!
That child cannot get in!

80
00:07:20,140 --> 00:07:22,416
He is coming with me!
Get in, Choppy!

81
00:07:24,020 --> 00:07:26,376
I am a guest of the Queen!

82
00:07:26,420 --> 00:07:28,173
- Should I get out?
- No, it doesn't matter.

83
00:07:28,220 --> 00:07:29,734
Let's go!

84
00:07:29,780 --> 00:07:32,579
- You go on ahead!
- What do you mean?

85
00:07:32,620 --> 00:07:34,577
If you want to go, go by yourselves!

86
00:07:34,620 --> 00:07:36,577
That carriage has no horses!

87
00:07:36,620 --> 00:07:38,771
What? It has no horses?!

88
00:07:39,700 --> 00:07:42,135
It is those who get inside
who make it go.

89
00:07:42,180 --> 00:07:44,820
Everyone, here in Coolland,
can make a carriage go

90
00:07:44,860 --> 00:07:47,011
...without horses,
if they aren't too stupid!

91
00:07:47,060 --> 00:07:49,814
- Did you understand, Choppy?
- No, absolutely not!

92
00:07:51,020 --> 00:07:53,012
Well, I'll try anyway.

93
00:07:57,020 --> 00:07:59,012
That is a warning whistle!

94
00:08:06,900 --> 00:08:09,210
This carriage is nice
without horses!

95
00:08:09,260 --> 00:08:11,377
You move this
and it goes in every direction.

96
00:08:11,420 --> 00:08:13,537
Sapphire, I'm scared! Stop it!

97
00:08:13,580 --> 00:08:17,176
The thing is, I really don't know
how to stop it!

98
00:08:19,820 --> 00:08:23,131
- The scenery is always gloomy, huh?
- Yes.

99
00:08:23,460 --> 00:08:25,531
There are traces of battle here

100
00:08:25,580 --> 00:08:28,015
This land fought
against Coolland.

101
00:08:28,220 --> 00:08:32,373
I'm sure that many
people died. I'm sure. I can feel it!

102
00:08:35,060 --> 00:08:37,450
Look, look what a big city!

103
00:08:39,180 --> 00:08:41,570
I wonder
if anyone still lives there

104
00:08:41,620 --> 00:08:43,532
Soon we will arrive at the capital.

105
00:09:04,741 --> 00:09:08,256
How big it is! There are buildings
very large ones all around!

106
00:09:08,301 --> 00:09:11,896
Sapphire, watch out! Watch
out! Look ahead! Look! Look!

107
00:09:11,941 --> 00:09:14,136
There's a moat!

108
00:09:14,181 --> 00:09:16,775
Hey, lower the bridge!

109
00:09:24,421 --> 00:09:26,093
I'm scared!

110
00:09:29,381 --> 00:09:34,409
This is a salute shot!
Welcome, Princess Sapphire!

111
00:09:34,461 --> 00:09:36,656
- How clumsy they are!
- Yes...

112
00:09:53,181 --> 00:09:56,173
The Queen has arrived!

113
00:10:14,901 --> 00:10:18,132
I am the Queen of this country.
Icicle.

114
00:10:18,181 --> 00:10:21,651
Thank you for the invitation.
I am Sapphire of Silverland.

115
00:10:21,701 --> 00:10:24,010
I have heard a lot about you.

116
00:10:25,021 --> 00:10:27,854
I'm sorry to have broken
your beautiful carriage.

117
00:10:27,901 --> 00:10:31,098
It doesn't matter. There are
many carriages in my land.

118
00:10:31,221 --> 00:10:34,816
Can you tell me where he
ended up Choppy, my friend?

119
00:10:35,301 --> 00:10:39,180
Don't worry, he is waiting
for you at the exit of the castle.

120
00:10:42,541 --> 00:10:45,931
No! No! Where do you want to take me? No!

121
00:10:57,621 --> 00:11:00,260
- I told you to let go of me!
- There you go!

122
00:11:09,501 --> 00:11:12,652
- What is this?
- It's a train, son.

123
00:11:12,701 --> 00:11:14,419
A train?!

124
00:11:14,461 --> 00:11:17,498
Yes, it's the train that
will take us all to hell.

125
00:11:17,741 --> 00:11:19,413
What?!

126
00:11:31,421 --> 00:11:33,491
Sapphire, help!

127
00:11:33,861 --> 00:11:36,898
What do you think of my
country, Princess Sapphire?

128
00:11:37,741 --> 00:11:40,130
Don't you think it is the most
beautiful country in the world?

129
00:11:40,181 --> 00:11:42,775
- Yes, I think so.
- It certainly is.

130
00:11:42,821 --> 00:11:46,018
Wouldn't you want to be an
ally of such a beautiful country?

131
00:11:46,261 --> 00:11:50,254
Both Copperland and Yalland
have fought against my country...

132
00:11:50,301 --> 00:11:52,292
...and they suffered
many losses.

133
00:11:52,341 --> 00:11:55,174
But I don't want your
country to suffer too.

134
00:11:55,301 --> 00:11:57,132
What do you mean?

135
00:11:57,181 --> 00:11:59,331
Think about it on your own.

136
00:11:59,381 --> 00:12:02,293
You will understand it by
yourself, because you are smart.

137
00:12:02,901 --> 00:12:05,096
Look at the power Coolland has.

138
00:12:10,301 --> 00:12:13,099
Those horrendous tanks
crushed Copperland.

139
00:12:21,381 --> 00:12:24,054
That blaze of fire
burned Yalland!

140
00:12:35,301 --> 00:12:37,861
You are asking me
to become your allies...

141
00:12:37,901 --> 00:12:40,017
...before we are
crushed as well?!

142
00:12:40,181 --> 00:12:43,332
If you do not want to suffer, you had better
surrender immediately!

143
00:12:43,381 --> 00:12:45,099
Now answer me!

144
00:12:46,781 --> 00:12:48,612
My answer is no!

145
00:12:48,661 --> 00:12:51,221
What?! Are you serious, Sapphire?

146
00:12:51,261 --> 00:12:53,900
I categorically reject
your offer!

147
00:12:53,941 --> 00:12:56,409
Do you intend
to ruin Silverland?

148
00:12:56,461 --> 00:12:59,851
Aren't you worried that your
precious land will go to ruin?

149
00:12:59,901 --> 00:13:02,540
Of course the fate
of my land worries me!

150
00:13:03,061 --> 00:13:06,019
But we would rather go to ruin
than surrender!

151
00:13:06,061 --> 00:13:08,017
Even if Coolland is beautiful,

152
00:13:08,061 --> 00:13:10,017
I will tell my father
that it is an unpleasant country!

153
00:13:10,061 --> 00:13:12,655
Well said, Sapphire,
but remember well...

154
00:13:12,701 --> 00:13:15,215
...what happens
to those who oppose Coolland!

155
00:13:16,381 --> 00:13:20,420
Go to Silverland!
Go and tell Geralamon...

156
00:13:20,461 --> 00:13:22,816
...to call Satan immediately!

157
00:13:31,501 --> 00:13:34,254
Hey, have you seen my friend
around here?

158
00:13:35,021 --> 00:13:37,854
They say he went back
before you did.

159
00:13:37,901 --> 00:13:39,732
What? He went back?!

160
00:13:39,781 --> 00:13:43,330
I think he got tired of it, but we can
catch up to him right away, if you want.

161
00:13:53,021 --> 00:13:55,251
How insolent that Sapphire is!

162
00:13:55,301 --> 00:13:57,769
- Gelo, have you prepared that plan?
- Yes!

163
00:13:57,821 --> 00:14:02,258
My little bird must have already
arrived at Geralamon's house.

164
00:14:32,021 --> 00:14:34,216
Grand Duke, I have brought Satan

165
00:14:34,261 --> 00:14:37,173
He said that Choppy isn't there
and I rushed here.

166
00:14:37,941 --> 00:14:41,217
Certainly! Now things
will go according to plan...

167
00:14:41,261 --> 00:14:44,253
...and you can take
Sapphire's heart as agreed.

168
00:14:45,941 --> 00:14:48,296
And you can take Silverland!

169
00:15:04,821 --> 00:15:08,052
What is Sapphire doing now?
I wonder if she's alright...!

170
00:15:08,101 --> 00:15:11,571
There is no need to worry. Surely
she is sleeping soundly now.

171
00:15:39,901 --> 00:15:42,290
I wonder what on earth that could be..!

172
00:16:08,861 --> 00:16:10,533
And who are you?

173
00:16:12,061 --> 00:16:15,451
Don't try the impossible!
You will never beat me!

174
00:16:16,301 --> 00:16:18,019
Damn you!

175
00:16:21,461 --> 00:16:25,295
You won't defeat me!
Oh, I can't move!

176
00:16:25,821 --> 00:16:29,609
I told you not to try! And
now, don't move anymore!

177
00:16:31,021 --> 00:16:32,818
What's happening?

178
00:16:35,421 --> 00:16:37,013
Darling!

179
00:16:38,941 --> 00:16:41,455
- Sapphire!
- Don't worry!

180
00:16:41,501 --> 00:16:44,174
Soon I will bring here
Princess Sapphire as well!

181
00:16:44,221 --> 00:16:46,416
And Sapphire will be left without a heart!

182
00:16:46,461 --> 00:16:48,053
Sapphire!

183
00:17:23,861 --> 00:17:25,658
What happened?

184
00:17:26,021 --> 00:17:29,013
I'm sorry, but I really think
it doesn't work anymore.

185
00:17:29,621 --> 00:17:31,657
It doesn't matter, let's walk.

186
00:17:31,701 --> 00:17:35,171
I can't come, but up there is
the road that leads to the border.

187
00:17:41,021 --> 00:17:43,012
Hey, you! You can come out!

188
00:17:44,821 --> 00:17:48,780
What a pain! I'm tired of
always taking orders from Gelo.

189
00:17:49,341 --> 00:17:51,536
Let's hurry, we're late!

190
00:18:09,301 --> 00:18:11,895
- Sapphire!
- Choppy!

191
00:18:12,861 --> 00:18:15,819
- Help!
- Wait!

192
00:18:18,221 --> 00:18:20,610
- Help!
- Wait!

193
00:18:20,661 --> 00:18:22,777
Give me back Choppy!

194
00:18:25,621 --> 00:18:27,020
Choppy!

195
00:18:29,621 --> 00:18:31,418
Choppy!

196
00:18:39,661 --> 00:18:43,290
But this is a doll! Damn
it, I've been tricked!

197
00:18:43,741 --> 00:18:45,857
Who did this to me?

198
00:18:58,661 --> 00:19:00,697
Everything went well!

199
00:19:01,301 --> 00:19:04,611
Now we can go to Silverland.

200
00:19:15,381 --> 00:19:17,611
Damn it! I won't die!

201
00:19:20,701 --> 00:19:22,851
I can't open my eyes!

202
00:19:25,141 --> 00:19:27,018
They hurt!

203
00:19:31,621 --> 00:19:35,330
It's completely
dark... I can't see!

204
00:19:36,061 --> 00:19:38,131
I must go back to Silverland!

205
00:19:47,821 --> 00:19:50,654
There is no one here!
No one who can tell me...

206
00:19:50,701 --> 00:19:52,896
...if this is the
road to Silverland!

207
00:20:21,021 --> 00:20:24,138
Where are you going? You can't
cross the border without permission!

208
00:20:24,341 --> 00:20:26,332
The border? I remember!

209
00:20:26,381 --> 00:20:28,849
You are the guard I saw
yesterday! I am Sapphire!

210
00:20:28,901 --> 00:20:31,210
I am the Princess of Silverland!

211
00:20:31,341 --> 00:20:36,210
What are you talking about?! There's
no way such a dirty Princess could exist!

212
00:20:36,341 --> 00:20:39,458
- What do you think? - I think so
too! It's better to kill her!

213
00:20:40,421 --> 00:20:42,252
What do you want to do?

214
00:20:42,301 --> 00:20:45,293
Do you want to fight
even though you are blind?

215
00:20:55,701 --> 00:20:57,657
Come on! Come on! Where are you?

216
00:21:02,461 --> 00:21:05,658
Tell me where Silverland is!
Show me the way right now!

217
00:21:05,701 --> 00:21:09,171
Yes, yes, I'll show you!
I will guide you myself!

218
00:21:11,781 --> 00:21:15,820
Silverland must be close: I feel
that the smell of the wind has changed.

219
00:21:15,941 --> 00:21:17,897
Soon I will meet my mother.

220
00:21:31,901 --> 00:21:35,132
Thank you, now I can proceed
on my own. Thank you!

221
00:21:37,021 --> 00:21:40,013
Despite being blind,
she is truly very strong.

222
00:21:56,621 --> 00:22:00,296
Open the gate!
I am Sapphire! Can't you hear me?

223
00:22:02,021 --> 00:22:04,694
I am Sapphire! Open the gate!

224
00:22:06,741 --> 00:22:08,015
Who is it?

225
00:22:10,301 --> 00:22:12,895
Those voices belong to
Geralamon and Neelon!

226
00:22:13,021 --> 00:22:15,899
Why are you laughing?
What's so funny?

227
00:22:17,421 --> 00:22:19,173
Damn lunatic!

228
00:22:19,221 --> 00:22:22,019
How dare you address the Grand Duke
without calling him "Grand Duke"?

229
00:22:22,381 --> 00:22:24,451
You are the gatekeeper,
aren't you?

230
00:22:24,501 --> 00:22:26,571
I am Sapphire! Don't you recognize me?

231
00:22:30,541 --> 00:22:34,216
- What are you laughing at so much?!
- Don't try to confuse us!

232
00:22:34,261 --> 00:22:37,219
Princess Sapphire
has already returned to the castle.

233
00:22:37,421 --> 00:22:40,333
What?! Let me see
my father and my mother,

234
00:22:40,381 --> 00:22:42,292
so you'll know that I am Sapphire!

235
00:22:42,341 --> 00:22:44,571
- My father and my mother
aren't here. - What?!

236
00:22:46,221 --> 00:22:48,610
They left the castle to me
and they've gone...

237
00:22:48,661 --> 00:22:51,095
...on a secret journey.
- And who are you?

238
00:22:51,901 --> 00:22:55,337
I am the real Sapphire
and you'd better leave!

239
00:22:55,381 --> 00:22:58,851
- I remember your voice.
- Then who do you think I am?

240
00:22:59,861 --> 00:23:03,410
I've got it now! You're that guy who
threw me off the cliff

241
00:23:03,461 --> 00:23:05,213
.using Choppy's voice!

242
00:23:05,901 --> 00:23:08,051
- Wait!
- Stop!

243
